      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d38b28fdb604f0",
      "translationZh": "发布：llm-openai-decisions 0.1a0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7645494a95c11d0a",
      "translationZh": "OpenAI 发布了全新的 Jev 风格 Decisions API，此前已在上周的 DevDay 上宣布过这一消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8129eb0f88cc2ba7",
      "translationZh": "由于我已经有一个用于与 Jev 通信的 llm-typesafe 插件，我便让 GPT-6 Astra 阅读新的 OpenAI API 文档，并参考 llm-typesafe 构建了一个 llm-openai-decisions 插件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3868a097aa175a0e",
      "translationZh": "与 Jev 不同，新的 gpt-6-luna 决策模型除了文本之外，还支持图像输入。两个模型都只对输入收费，不对输出收费：OpenAI 的价格为每百万输入 token 10 美分，Jev 的价格为每百万输入 token 4.2 美分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4fbe7050ace02ec",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，API 的形式与 Jev 非常相似，至少在概念上是如此。Jev 支持三种问题类型：是/否、选项或评分。OpenAI Decisions 也支持同样的三种类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2aaaf73fb22f3e32",
      "translationZh": "按以下方式安装插件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5d3f7fce45f1818",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个针对图像附件进行查询的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a07667bfae10900a",
      "translationZh": "有关如何运行其他类型问题的完整说明，请参阅 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
